            "  Repo commands are fixed read-only summaries over allowlisted Git repos.",
            "  Quiet after-answer maintenance saves high-confidence durable memories and compacts long chats.",
            "  The background study loop refreshes catalogs and suggestions while idle.",
            "  Attached stale indexes can refresh in bg-heavy: indexing(model) while prompts queue.",
            "  Heavy idle profile refresh is opt-in with MOTOKO_BACKGROUND_PROFILE=1.",
            "  Source documents are modified only by typed confirmed actions.",
            "  Spinner modes: MOTOKO_SPINNER=auto|ascii|block|braille|off.",
